Subject: [PATCH 102/110] CONCORD LP exchange

The LP store's exchange turns CONCORD LP into another corporation's
LP:  0.8 for the corporations of the empire factions (and Ammatar,
Khanid), 0.4 for the fringe factions (Syndicate, ORE, Thukker, Sisters
of EVE, Society, Mordu's Legion), whatever the standings.  Pirate and
militia corporations and CONCORD itself can't be exchanged to.  One way
only, no fee.  GetLPExchangeRates returns the rate of every corporation
with an LP store that takes CONCORD LP.
---
 src/eve-server/corporation/LPService.cpp | 108 +++++++++++++++++++----
 src/eve-server/corporation/LPService.h   |  10 ++-
 2 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

